# Maze: walled corridors with loops and no dead ends, around an open
# court where you start. Enemies come round corners from all four sides.
#
#   #  wall (wall_height)   =  crate (crate_height)   O  pillar
#   P  player start         E  enemy spawn            .  floor
# One character is `tile` metres; the '#' border is the outer wall.

name          Maze
tile          2
wall_height   2.6
crate_height  1.0
pillar_height 5

map
